Z||000018||87FieroGTx||11-19-2001||11:12 AM|||| Anyone who knows me knows I like Simple, Refined, Subtile, Elegant cars and this is not one of them!<P> To "ME" the car looks like it's trying to hard. It reminds me of my high school days when a rich kid would try to be "COOL" by going out to the "COOL" store and buy the in style clothes but he didn't stop there he also bought in style sunglasses, shoes, 3 necklaces, hat, bandana, Walkman, watches, sox Then were them all at once! (1 watch is "cool" so 3 must be even cooler, right?<P> ~GOOD~<P> I like the seats!<P> I like the stearing wheel!<P> I like the shifter gate!<P> The Exhaust tips are cool. (A little long)<P> ~NOW FOR THE BAD~<P> Wing = to tall (I'm a no wing kinda guy)<BR> <BR> Scoop = Not good!<P> 1/4 windows = NO!<P> Hood = never!<P> Wheels = Even worse!<P> Please don't take this as a flame, being a Fiero I have love for it. The car is just 180 degrease from my tastes.<P>------------------<BR>85 Fiero GT ~ auto 3.2 200hp 220tq ~ 75+ shot NOS ~ 0-60 4.9 13.5 1/4||||reg||1
